# Second Chapter

A second chapter to verify the running header updates correctly between
chapters and that page-numbering continues sequentially.

<!-- Smoke-test note: this in-repo example references the theme via `../loader.qd`
     (theme at repo root), so it does NOT reproduce the consumer layout
     `<docroot>/themes/fau-lme/`. The `.lmebibliography` wrapper hard-codes a `../../`
     prefix that assumes that consumer layout, so here we call `.bibliography`
     directly with the theme's CSL style. Real projects (main.qd at `<docroot>/main.qd`
     + theme at `<docroot>/themes/fau-lme/`) use `.lmebibliography {refs.bib}` — see README. -->
.bibliography {refs.bib} style:{lme-alpha} title:{References}
